t":530}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"汇编语言处于第 3 阶段：在转换为二进制之前的最终人类可读形式。每条汇编指令都对应一个处理器操作：如数字相加、加载内存或跳转到不同的代码段。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":534},"end":{"line":25,"column":71,"offset":604}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1,"offset":534},"end":{"line":25,"column":71,"offset":604}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"sBPF 虚拟机","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":17,"offset":624},"end":{"line":27,"column":32,"offset":639}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"the-sbpf-virtual-machine","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":33,"offset":640},"end":{"line":27,"column":62,"offset":669}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":63,"offset":670},"end":{"line":27,"column":73,"offset":680}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1,"offset":608},"end":{"line":27,"column":76,"offset":683}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solana sBPF 是 Solana 定制的扩展伯克利数据包过滤器（eBPF）指令集和虚拟机，负责执行每个链上程序。它创建了一个专门的执行环境：一个 64 位寄存器机器，位于你的程序和验证器的原生 CPU 之间。","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1,"offset":687},"end":{"line":29,"column":109,"offset":795}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1,"offset":687},"end":{"line":29,"column":109,"offset":795}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"可以将 sBPF 想象成一个为区块链执行而设计的专用计算机：既足够快以支持高吞吐量交易，又足够受限以确保数千个验证器之间的安全性和确定性。","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":799},"end":{"line":31,"column":70,"offset":868}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1,"offset":799},"end":{"line":31,"column":70,"offset":868}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"与直接在 CPU 上运行的原生汇编不同，sBPF 代码在受控的虚拟机环境中执行。这个虚拟机通过在执行前验证每条指令来保证安全性，防止崩溃、无限循环和未经授权的内存访问。","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":872},"end":{"line":33,"column":85,"offset":956}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":872},"end":{"line":33,"column":85,"offset":956}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"尽管有这些安全限制，sBPF 通过 ","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1,"offset":960},"end":{"line":35,"column":19,"offset":978}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"just-in-time","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":19,"offset":978},"end":{"line":35,"column":33,"offset":992}}},{"type":"text","value":" 编译保持了高性能，几乎达到了原生执行速度。","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":33,"offset":992},"end":{"line":35,"column":55,"offset":1014}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1,"offset":960},"end":{"line":35,"column":55,"offset":1014}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"虚拟机还确保了执行的确定性：相同的程序在相同的输入下会在全球所有验证者中产生相同的结果。这种一致性对于区块链共识至关重要。","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1,"offset":1018},"end":{"line":37,"column":62,"offset":1079}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1,"offset":1018},"end":{"line":37,"column":62,"offset":1079}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"此外，sBPF 包括用于账户访问、跨程序调用和运行时交互的系统调用（syscalls）。","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1,"offset":1083},"end":{"line":39,"column":45,"offset":1127}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1,"offset":1083},"end":{"line":39,"column":45,"offset":1127}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为什么理解 sBPF 汇编很重要","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":5,"offset":1135},"end":{"line":41,"column":21,"offset":1151}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1,"offset":1131},"end":{"line":41,"column":21,"offset":1151}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"虽然 Rust 编译器可以高效地将高级代码翻译成 sBPF 指令，但理解汇编语言有以下几个优势：","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":1155},"end":{"line":43,"column":49,"offset":1203}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":1155},"end":{"line":43,"column":49,"offset":1203}}},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"start":null,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"chil